  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuzuukira kwa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu makya g'olunaku olusooka mu wiiki, Maliyamu Magudaleene n'ajja ku ntaana, ng'obudde tebunnalaba bulungi, n'alaba ejjinja nga liggiddwa ku ntaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'adduka n'agenda eri Simooni Peetero n'eri omuyigirizwa omulala Yesu gwe yayagalanga ennyo n'abagamba nti, \"Mukama waffe bamuggyeemu mu ntaana, era simanyi gye bamutadde!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Peetero n'omuyigirizwa oli omulala ne bafuluma ne balaga ku ntaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bombi ne bagenda nga badduka, omuyigirizwa oli omulala n'ayisa Peetero n'amusooka ku ntaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'akutama n'alaba engoye za linena nga ziteekeddwa awo, kyokka n'atayingira mu ntaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ne Simooni Peetero n'atuuka, n'ayingira mu ntaana, n'alaba engoye za linena nga ziteekeddwa awo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'alaba n'ekitambaala ekyali ku mutwe gwa Yesu. Kyali tekiteekeddwa wamu na ngoye, wabula kyali kizingiddwa era nga kiteekebbwa ku bbali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'omuyigirizwa oli omulala, eyasooka okutuuka ku ntaana n'ayingira. N'alaba era n'akkiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubanga okutuusiza ddala mu kiseera ekyo baali tebannategeera ekyawandiikibwa nti: Kimugwanira okuzuukira mu bafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abayigirizwa ne baddayo ewaabwe eka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Alabikira Maliyamu Magudaleene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maliyamu Magudaleene yali ayimiridde wabweru w'entaana ng'akaaba. N'akutama. N'alingiza mu ntaana nga bw'akaaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'alaba bamalayika babiri, nga bali mu ngoye enjeru nga batudde; omu emitwetwe n'omulala emirannamiro w'ekifo omulambo gwa Yesu we gwali guteekeddwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamalayika ne bamubuuza nti, \"Omukyala, okaabira ki?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 20:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "N'abaddamu nti, \"Kubanga baggyeemu Mukama wange, era simanyi gye bamutadde!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yamala okwogera ebyo, n'akyuka n'alaba Yesu ng'ayimiridde, kyokka n'atamanya nti ye Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'amubuuza nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Omukyala okaabira ki? Onoonya ani?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 20:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maliyamu n'alowooza nti, Ye nannyini nnimiro n'amugamba nti, \"Ssebo, obanga gw'omuggyeemu, mbuulira gy'omutadde ŋŋende mmuggyeyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'amugamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Maliyamu!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 20:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maliyamu n'akyukira Yesu n'amugamba mu Lwebbulaniya nti, \"Labooni,\" ekitegeeza nti, \"Omuyigiriza.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'amugamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Tonkwatako kubanga sinnagenda eri Kitange. Naye genda eri baganda bange obagambe nti, ŋŋenda eri Kitange era Kitammwe, Katonda wange era Katonda wammwe.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maliyamu Magudaleene n'agenda n'abuulira abayigirizwa nga bw'alabye Mukama waffe, era n'abategeeza by'amugambye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Alabikira Abayigirizwa be",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawungeezi ako abayigirizwa baali bakuŋŋaanidde mu kisenge ng'enzigi nsibe olw'okutya Abayudaaya, Yesu n'ajja n'ayimirira wakati mu bo. N'abagamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Emirembe gibe mu mmwe.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yamala okwogera ebyo n'abalaga ebibatu bye n'embiriizi ze. Abayigirizwa bwe baalaba Mukama ne basanyuka nnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'addamu nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Emirembe gibe mu mmwe. Nga Kitange bwe yantuma, nange bwe mbatuma mmwe.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yamala okwogera ebyo n'abassiza omukka, n'abagamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Mufune Mwoyo Mutukuvu.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Buli muntu gwe munaasonyiwanga ebibi bye anaabanga asonyiyiddwa. Abo be munaagaananga okusonyiwa, banaabanga tebasonyiyiddwa.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Alabikira Tomasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Tomasi, omu ku bayigirizwa ekkumi n'ababiri, ayitibwa Didumo, teyali na banne Yesu bwe yajja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayigirizwa banne ne bamugamba nti, \"Tulabye Mukama waffe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 20:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ye n'abagamba nti, \"Okuggyako nga ndabye enkovu ez'emisumaali mu bibatu bye, ne nteeka olunwe lwange mu nkovu ezo era ne nteeka ekibatu kyange mu mbiriizi ze, sigenda kukkiriza.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe waayitawo ennaku munaana, abayigirizwa ba Yesu, era bali mu nnyumba, Tomasi yali nabo. Yesu n'ajja, enzigi nga nsibe, n'ayimirira wakati mu bo n'abagamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Emirembe gibe mu mmwe,\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo n'agamba Tomasi nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Kale teeka engalo zo wano, laba ebibatu byange. Teeka ekibatu kyo mu mbiriizi zange. Lekeraawo okuba atakkiriza, naye kkiriza.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomasi n'amuddamu nti, \"Ggwe Mukama wange era Katonda wange.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'amugamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Okkirizza kubanga ondabye. Balina omukisa abakkiriza nga tebaliiko kye balabye.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.20.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.20.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yakola ebyamagero ebirala bingi ng'abayigirizwa be balaba, ebitaawandiikibwa mu kitabo kino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye bino byawandiikibwa mulyoke mukkirize nti Yesu ye Kristo Omwana wa Katonda era olw'okumukkiriza mulyoke mube n'obulamu mu linnya lye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
